        {
          "title": "Photography first. A broader practice since.",
          "body": "My journey began at Apex Studio in Jaipur in 2017, photographing events and refining images in Photoshop and Lightroom. At Wow Graphics in Jodhpur, I brought that experience into customized products, print artwork, school photography and catalog design.\n\nFrom 2021 to 2024, I ran Rudra Customized Gifting. Working directly with customers meant taking ideas from the first conversation through artwork, photography, listings and production—including selling through Amazon, Flipkart and Meesho."
